{
  "name": "RE Lead Nurturing Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Lead Nurturing Agent\n\n**TENEX Equivalent:** Coder Agent implementing features in isolated branch\n\n**Core Function:** Maintains engagement throughout the 6+ month typical lead nurturing cycle. Responds within 5 minutes (100x conversion improvement) and executes personalized drip campaigns based on lead behavior.\n\n## Trigger Events\n- New inquiry\n- Website visit\n- Open house signup\n- Property save\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Response time (<5 min target)\n- Engagement rate\n- Lead-to-appointment conversion\n- Nurture duration",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -200],
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Agent Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Credentials to Configure\n\n1. `CRM_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Your CRM API (Follow Up Boss, kvCORE, etc.)\n2. `TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Twilio for SMS\n3. `GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Gmail OAuth2\n4. `OPENROUTER_CREDENTIAL_ID` → AI for personalization\n5. `GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Lead tracking sheet\n\n## Variables to Set\n- `AGENT_NAME` → Your name\n- `AGENT_PHONE` → Your phone number\n- `AGENT_EMAIL` → Your email\n- `CRM_BASE_URL` → Your CRM API endpoint",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, 200],
      "id": "sticky-credentials",
      "name": "Credentials Setup"
    },
    {
